'''Summon Harbinger of Focus''' is a [[spell]] that summons an allied Harbinger [[minion]]. The skill is only available through {{il|The Unshattered Will}}.

==Skill Functions and Interactions==
The Harbinger is immortal and will occasionally apply "The Unshattered Will" on the player character while the player character is [[channelling]]. "The Unshattered Will" is a [[buff]] that lasts 4 seconds, with a cooldown of 8 seconds, and grants the following benefits:
* Immunity to elemental [[ailment]]s
* Stun immunity
* 20% less damage taken (the stat {{c|mod|harbinger_channel_buff_damage_taken_+%_final}})

==Drop restrictions==
Harbinger of Focus can only be obtained by equipping {{il|The Unshattered Will}}.
